Package: fromage
Type: Package
Title: Multimodel Q Control Chart for Autocorrelated Data
Description: Implements the multimodel Q (QMM) control chart for monitoring
    changes in the serial dependence of an autocorrelated process. The method
    combines fixed-parameter
    autoregressive moving-average residuals, the Ljung-Box statistic,
    information-criterion weights, coupled monitoring windows, and a
    parametric bootstrap. The underlying ideas build on Ljung and Box (1978)
    <doi:10.1093/biomet/65.2.297>, Hurvich and Tsai (1989)
    <doi:10.1093/biomet/76.2.297>, and Burnham and Anderson (2002,
    ISBN:9780387953649).
Version: 0.1.0
